          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu alirora atali na itwe, naija kufa; itwe abairu bawe, omwiru wawe isiitwe, n'enju ze omu mutwe, arukusaalirwa ati, turaaba tumuziikire Nyabuyonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba nyowe omwiru wawe, ninyowe nayesimbire hali isenyowe habw'omwojo ogu ningamba nti: ‘Obu ntalimukugarurra, ninyowe olijunaana obwomeezi bwange bwona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki mukama wange, nkwesengeriize, ninyowe osigaze mbe mwiru wawe, omu kiikaro ky'ogu, baitu uwe, omuleke agarukeyo na bagenzi be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 44:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsobora nta kugaruka hali ise nyowe ntaina omwojo ogu? Tindukwenda kurora isenyowe naizirwa akabi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.44.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.44.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
